            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What keyword do we use to create a while loop?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>while</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>while</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You want code to repeat while a condition is true. Which keyword starts that loop?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>while</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>if</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>while</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 72691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we know when a while loop will stop?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By checking its condition</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">By checking its keyword</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">By checking its condition.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A loop has started running. What tells you whether it will stop or run another time?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By checking its condition</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">By checking its keyword</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">By checking the braces</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick By checking its condition.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Code block",
            "id": 72692,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What are the braces <code>{ }</code> and code inside of them called?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Echo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A code block</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A condition</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A code block.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In this loop, which part would repeat if the condition became <code>true</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Echo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A code block</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A condition</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A keyword</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick A code block.</p></body></html>"
