            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A loop's condition never becomes <code>false</code>. What kind of loop is it?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">An infinite loop</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A while loop</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A code block</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick An infinite loop.</p></body></html>"
