            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when the condition of this while loop stays <code>true</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The loop repeats itself forever and crashes the program</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The loop runs its code block once</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The loop repeats itself forever and crashes the program.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A while loop checks its condition before running the code block. If it starts <code>false</code>, the block is skipped.</p><p>You replace <code>true</code> with <code>false</code> in this loop. What happens when you run it?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It prints no messages because the code block is skipped.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It prints Polly wants a cracker! once before checking.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It still repeats forever because the text is inside a loop.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It prints no messages because the code block is skipped.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
